		(property "Design Note" "3V3A rail monitor divider, 1:2 into MCU PA7/ADC_IN7 and (via R37) ADS1119 AIN. FIRMWARE: VA_MON_MV = 2 x ADC. Like the R26/R27 VIN monitor this is a supply health check, so 1% would do; it uses the precision 10k only because R25 shares the position. NOTE the other two users of that stock position, R21 and R22, were deleted with the trim divider and the guard divider, so R24/R25 are now the only ones; revisit the grade at the next sourcing pass"
